<h2>The old rule and the new text</h2>
<div class="compare">
  <div class="col old">
    <h3>Section 167 CrPC (as read in Kulkarni)</h3>
    <p>Police custody only within the <strong>first fifteen days</strong> following the first remand. Thereafter, only judicial custody, even if new facts surfaced in the same case.</p>
