    <p>Custody of up to fifteen days in total, which may be sought <strong>in whole or in parts</strong>, within the first <strong>forty days</strong> (offences punishable up to ten years) or <strong>sixty days</strong> (graver offences) of the sixty or ninety day detention period.</p>
